NOTE ON GENERATED MEDIA

The MIT license above covers the *code* in this repository.

Media produced by running this code -- rendered frames, synthesized music and
sound effects, episode scripts, thumbnails and finished videos -- is the
property of the repository owner and is NOT covered by the MIT grant. Nothing
in this pipeline downloads, samples or derives from third-party media: visuals
are drawn by Pillow, music is synthesized from oscillators in numpy, and
narration is spoken by Microsoft Edge's free TTS voices (check Microsoft's
terms for your own use of those voices).
